WEBVTT

00:00:02.682 --> 00:00:03.583
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> <b>Part 2</b>

00:00:11.995 --> 00:00:15.466
Hassan walks for five days through the mountains.

00:00:16.128 --> 00:00:20.880
The sun shines. At night, it’s very cold.

00:00:21.977 --> 00:00:27.459
Then, one evening, he arrives at a rich and beautiful palace.

00:00:28.295 --> 00:00:30.895
The prince in the palace welcomes him.

00:00:31.446 --> 00:00:37.276
He gives him food and drink, and Hassan sleeps in a comfortable bed.

00:00:38.719 --> 00:00:44.933
There is one strange thing – the windows have no glass.

00:00:46.265 --> 00:00:49.178
The next day, Hassan says goodbye.

00:00:50.123 --> 00:00:57.678
He wants to thank the prince and give him something, but he only has his empty water bottle.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:03.364
He gives it to him. The prince is very surprised.

00:01:04.381 --> 00:01:13.387
"What’s this?" he says. "I can see through it! It’s beautiful! It’s wonderful!"

00:01:14.254 --> 00:01:20.676
He is very happy, and in return he gives Hassan a box.

00:01:22.226 --> 00:01:26.222
"Don’t open it until you get home," he says.

00:01:26.772 --> 00:01:31.110
"And be careful with it. It’s very valuable."

00:01:33.071 --> 00:01:39.844
Hassan walks through the mountains again, and after five days he arrives home.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:44.434
Walid and their mother watch him open the box.

00:01:45.244 --> 00:01:49.389
He finds 100 gold coins inside.

00:01:50.045 --> 00:02:02.113
His mother is very happy! "Hassan, you clever boy!" she says. "Now we can buy food and clothes!"

00:02:03.468 --> 00:02:07.868
The next night, Walid makes a plan.

00:02:09.676 --> 00:02:16.510
"100 gold coins in return for a glass bottle," he thinks.

00:02:17.166 --> 00:02:25.843
"If I give the prince my mother’s silver ring, perhaps I can get 1,000 gold coins!"

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:32.798
So Walid gets up, goes very quietly into his mother’s room,

00:02:33.387 --> 00:02:37.932
and takes her ring from a box under her bed.

00:02:39.333 --> 00:02:46.310
The next morning, he asks his brother where the palace is, and he leaves.